('deity.egyptian.atum_ra','Atum-Ra','阿图姆-拉','jtmw-rꜥ','Atum-Ra','DEITY','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','Persian-period witness in the current dossier; wider chronology remains open','阿图姆与拉的复合神名档案；当前明确证据来自大流士苏萨雕像的埃及语境学术研究。 / Composite Atum-Ra dossier currently anchored to the Egyptian context of the Darius statue at Susa.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"entity_model":"composite expression; components remain independent","name_order":"Atum-Ra in current witness"}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('deity.egyptian.atum_horakhty','Atum-Horakhty','阿图姆-哈拉赫提','jtmw-ḥr-ꜣḫty','Atum-Horakhty','DEITY','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','New Kingdom sun-hymn tradition represented by a scholarly digital edition','《亡灵书》第15章所收太阳赞歌见证中的复合称呼；与阿图姆-拉分开保存。 / Composite address in a Chapter 15 sun-hymn witness, stored separately from Atum-Ra.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"entity_model":"text-witness composite address","dedup_rule":"not merged with Atum-Ra"}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('text.egypt.book_dead_chapter15','Book of the Dead Chapter 15','《亡灵书》第15章太阳赞歌组',NULL,NULL,'TEXT','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','New Kingdom and later witnesses; modern chapter numbering','现代编目下的一组太阳赞歌，而非单一固定文本；不同纸草和墓室见证可保存不同版本。 / Modern chapter grouping for varied sun hymns rather than one fixed composition.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"witness_model":"modern chapter grouping with multiple ancient variants"}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('text.egypt.sun_hymn_standard_c_prime','Sun Hymn: Assmann Standard Hymn C-prime','太阳赞歌：Assmann 标准赞歌 C′',NULL,'i.nD Hr.k ra m wbn.k itm Hr-Axty','TEXT','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','New Kingdom sun-hymn tradition','UCL 数字版所列太阳赞歌定位实体，用于保存对拉与阿图姆-哈拉赫提的同一段见证。 / Section-level witness entity for the hymn addressing Ra in rising as Atum-Horakhty.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"locator":"UCL Book of the Dead 15 lines 15-40","not_a_whole_book":true}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('historical.achaemenid.darius_i','Darius I','大流士一世','Dārayavauš','Darius I','HISTORICAL_FIGURE','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Achaemenid king, 522-486 BCE','阿契美尼德国王；本批只建立苏萨雕像与埃及神学语境的有来源连接。 / Achaemenid king, here limited to the sourced Susa-statue and Egyptian-theological context.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"reality_status":"HISTORICAL_PERSON"}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('museum.iran.darius_susa_statue','Egyptian Statue of Darius I from Susa','苏萨出土大流士一世埃及式雕像',NULL,NULL,'MUSEUM_OBJECT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Achaemenid / Egyptian Dynasty 27, reign of Darius I','在埃及制作、后于苏萨发现的多语铭文雕像；埃及神学与阿契美尼德王权层分别记录。 / Egyptian-made multilingual statue found at Susa; Egyptian theological and Achaemenid royal layers remain distinct.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"reality_status":"ARCHAEOLOGICAL_OBJECT","cross_civilization_context":["Egyptian","Achaemenid"]}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
('concept.egyptian.rising_setting_solar_forms','Rising and setting solar forms','太阳升起与落下形态',NULL,NULL,'CONCEPT','civ.egyptian','region.northeast_africa','Diachronic funerary and hymn contexts','用于比较太阳升起与落下的神祇表达，不把不同神名强制等同。 / Comparison concept for rising and setting solar expressions without forcing deity identities.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"comparison_only":true,"no_identity_inference":true}','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z');

