('claim.v0120.statue_multilingual','museum.iran.darius_susa_statue','ASSOCIATED_WITH',NULL,'hieroglyphic, Old Persian, Elamite and Akkadian inscriptions','text','The statue bears hieroglyphic and three-language cuneiform inscription programs.','susa.darius.inscriptions','SUPPORTED',0.99,'HIGH','VERIFIED','HISTORICAL_REALITY','ARCHAEOLOGICAL','Multilingual inscription program','Darius I','Each inscription edition remains a future independent text witness.','2026-08-25T00:00:00Z'),
